Source: ps3-gpu-tools
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Maintainer: PS3 Linux project <ps3@localhost>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), libegl-dev, libgles-dev, libopengl-dev, libgl-dev
Standards-Version: 4.7.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: ps3-gpu-tools
Architecture: ppc64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: PS3 RSX probes, driver tests and GL tests
 Raw RSX probes and ps3rsx driver tests (rsx-*, rsxdrm-smoke), offscreen EGL/GL tests compared
 with softpipe (egl-*, gl-*), and the test scripts (rsx-suite.sh, rsx-x.sh, ...), in
 /usr/lib/ps3/bin with links in /usr/bin; ps3-mallocstat.so (glibc malloc statistics of a
 running game on request, for games/bench MEM=1) in /usr/lib/ps3/lib.
